# Formatting is the IDE's job, over the whole tree in one pass (the owner, 2026-09-20); nothing in CI or the test suite
# measures it. This file only keeps a formatter — Prettier from the IDE, or `npm run format` — off the files that are
# GENERATED and compared byte-for-byte by a gate: the docs `npm run docs` writes (the docs-drift check), the golden wire
# corpus (`UPDATE_GOLDEN=1` rewrites it in the generator's shape), and npm's lock file.
/docs/PARAMETERS.md
/docs/TEMPLATES.md
/docs/COMMANDS.md
/test/fixtures/golden/expected
/package-lock.json
